<h3><u>Tu hai bada rehman</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p>Aoozu billahe minash shaitanir rajim</p>

<p>Bismillah hir rahmanir rahiym</p>

<p>Ar-rahman allamal quran khalaqal insana allamahul bayan</p>

<p>Ya Rahman ya Rahim&hellip;..x3</p>

<p>Ya hayyo ya Qayyum, ya Razzak ya Azim</p>

<p>Al Nooro Al Mohanniyo Azizo ya Karim,</p>

<p>Gaffar tu sattar tu jabbar ya Hakim Quddoos ya Shakur ya Gafooro ya Rahim</p>

<p>Maula tu bara Rehman &hellip;&hellip;..x3</p>

<p>Tu hai bara Rehman maula tu bara Rehman &hellip;x2</p>

<p>Ehsan hampe hai tera ay rabbe zuljalal</p>

<p>Ummatne uski paida kiya jo hai be misal</p>

<p>Dukhtar Batul jiski Hassan or Hussain lal</p>

<p>Lehmo ka lehmi jiska Ali jaisa ba kamal</p>

<p>Qurano Ahlebait ko tune kiya yakjan</p>

<p>Adam se taubeme diya aakhir teri etaat</p>

<p>Tere karam ke bar tale sare Ambiya</p>

<p>Musa ke haq me nil me rastaa banadiya</p>

<p>Masloob hoke Essa ke labpar thi ye sada</p>

<p>Har dilme tu makin hai kehneko laamakan</p>

<p>Meraj par gaye jo Rasule falak janab</p>

<p>Maabudo abd me na raha jab koi hijab</p>

<p>Allah ne Nabise kiya us gari khitab</p>

<p>Darkar kya hai tumko mujhe chahiye jawab</p>

<p>Bole Rasul bakhshde ummat ko de amaan</p>

<p>Rabne kaha Adaa karo haqqe payambari</p>

<p>Jis waqt aaye rahme manzil gadirki</p>

<p>Taqmile din kama hai us waqt ay Nabi</p>

<p>Maidane qum me is tarah maula huwe Ali</p>

<p>Akmalto lakum din ka ho jayenga saman</p>

<p>Zehra ka ghar sitara jo utra to ye khula</p>

<p>Mehboob panjetan ko bahot rakhta hai khuda</p>

<p>Maktab Hasan Hussain ka ye ghar bana raha</p>

<p>Masnad Nabiki isme musalla Ali ka tha</p>

<p>Chaukhatpe jiski rehta hai jibrail se darban</p>

<p>Is gharka fard fard kuda se tha hamkalam</p>

<p>Sajdeme sar Hussainka labpar khuda ka naam</p>

<p>Khanjar tale khuda se ye kehte rahe Imam</p>

<p>Sar teri nazr kartahu ghar de chuka tamam</p>

<p>Aata hu teri simt mai deta huwa azaan</p>

<p>Akbar nisar kar diya Asghar bhi ro chuka</p>

<p>Abbas or Kasimo Hur ko bhi ro chuka</p>

<p>Zainab ke dono bachoko sehra me kho chuka</p>

<p>Ab daste zulm chadare Zainab ka kya gaya</p>

<p>Le dekhle Hussain ke chehre ka imtihan</p>

<p>Khaimo se aag aag se uthta huwa dhuwa</p>

<p>Nanna sa ek jula hai sholo ke darmiyan</p>

<p>Daman jala Sakina ka kaise bujaye maa</p>

<p>Bandhi gayi hai hato me Zainab ke reshma</p>

<p>Ujra huwa hai kafela Sajjad Saarva</p>

<p>Aayi sada Hussain ki ay kadiro kadir</p>

<p>Beti Ali ki meri bahan ho gayi asir</p>

<p>Be dast mera bhai hai tu sabka dastagir</p>

<p>Kufeki shahzadiya kaisi huyi fakir</p>

<p>Fir bhi mai nouke naiza pe deta hu ye bayan</p>
</p>